{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/321704-explain-spirit-influences-to-me-like-i-m-5","id":321704,"title":"Explain spirit influences to me like I'm 5","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-11-25T05:26:10-08:00","id":321704,"title":"Explain spirit influences to me like I'm 5","content":"Whelp, the title say it all. I'm having trouble getting a feel for how spirit influences work. Numina makes sense but influence is both broader and more limited in application. How does a spirit with influence dog 3 work? What about something that isn't an abstract emotion?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3905-llewyd42","name":"Llewyd42","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-25T07:28:33-08:00","id":321795,"title":"","content":"I haven't used the rules for spirits in GMC yet, and I'm sure someone will chime in to correct me if I'm wrong, but feel free to ask for more specific answers.<br /> <br /> If something is in the sphere of influence of a spirit, it has the Resonant condition. So, for your spirit of dogs, all dogs have the Resonant condition for it. With three dots in Influence: Dogs, it can Strengthen (with one Influence dot), granting things it's resonant with its Rank in health, and possibly other storyteller fiat things like amplifying dog abilities. Use of Strengthen can turn the Resonant condition to Open, letting the spirit fetter itself to the dog or pack of dogs. With two dots it can Manipulate, pushing and prodding the thing Resonant to it, making the dogs bark at a sneaking person to alert their owner, urge bloodhounds after the trail it wants them to follow, urge Lassie to alert Timmy's parents. At three dots of Influence: Dogs it can outright control dogs without need for manipulation, and can give them the Controlled condition (if it had the Open condition first), allowing the spirit to Claim them, permanently merging with the dog.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-25T07:32:42-08:00","id":321799,"title":"","content":"Well, first dot of an Influence is Strengthen. With this you can make the thing under the Influence umbrella (dogs in this case) stronger or more tough. Apply Successes to increase the Attributes, Size and so on of a given dog. It can also be used to heal a dog's Health.<br /> <br /> Second dot is Manipulate. With it you can make small changes to the dog's appearance (fur or eye color, those kind of things) or redirect their instictual responses, for example making the dog regard you as its master and so make it loyal to you, or redirect his agression to other person. You cannot make the dog make something it is not within its own instictual responses.<br /> <br /> With the third dot, Control, that previous limit is removed. You can make the dog do anything you want within its capabilities (dogs don't fly, for example) and can alter its appearance wildly (truning a german shepherd into a corgi or viceversa).<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-25T08:09:19-08:00","id":321833,"title":"","content":"Wow so they can be way more expansive then I gave them credit for. And at 4 dots you can outright create a brand new dog? Is it lasting or does it have a duration?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3905-llewyd42","name":"Llewyd42","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-25T08:23:33-08:00","id":321838,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Llewyd42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/321704-explain-spirit-influences-to-me-like-i-m-5?p=321833#post321833\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And at 4 dots you can outright create a brand new dog?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Is it lasting or does it have a duration? </div> </div> </div>There's a duration but there's a way to make it permanent, I think it requires a lot of Influence.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-25T08:46:04-08:00","id":321860,"title":"","content":"The fifth dot allows you to create a permanent example. Or, make a whole bunch of them temporarily.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3347-wild-eyes","name":"Wild-Eyes","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"121"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-25T08:54:12-08:00","id":321862,"title":"","content":"<img src=\"http://imgs.xkcd.com/comics/like_im_five.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> Sorry, had to. Besides, most of the other nice folk here already got it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-